<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for NY State appropriation debt.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for NY State appropriation debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Monday it has limited secondary market insurance for New York State annual appropriation debt.</p>
<p>The debt, rated Baa1/BBB, was sold for the following issuers:</p>
<p>--N.Y. State Dormitory Authority, State University.</p>
<p>--N.Y. State Dormitory Authority, City University.</p>
<p>--Urban Development Corp, Correctional Facilities.</p>
<p>--Metropolitan Authority, service contract.</p>
<p>Capacity is limited to $7.5 million per firm, and is available on a first-come, first-served basis. For more information, call 800-624-2669.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
